WEBVTT

1
00:01:51,670 --> 00:01:54,170
Taring Naga dicuri?

2
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:57,170
Sungguh mengerikan.

3
00:01:57,580 --> 00:01:59,539
Yang Mulia, tenang saja.

4
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:02,170
Saya sudah mengirim pasukan pengejar.

5
00:03:39,670 --> 00:03:47,120
(Bereinkarnasi Malah Menjadi Slime:
Babak Air Mata Samudra Biru)

6
00:03:48,750 --> 00:03:50,620
Namaku Mikami Satoru.

7
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:53,420
Bukan, maksudku Rimuru Tempest.

8
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,040
Dulunya, aku hanya manusia biasa

9
00:03:56,290 --> 00:03:59,790
yang bekerja di perusahaan konstruksi raksasa.

10
00:04:00,460 --> 00:04:01,960
Setelah mati ditusuk,

11
00:04:02,380 --> 00:04:05,250
aku bereinkarnasi menjadi slime,
seperti yang kalian lihat.

12
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:09,620
Yah, aku tidak mau pusing
memikirkan kenapa bisa begini,

13
00:04:09,790 --> 00:04:13,880
jadi, aku menikmati hidup sebagai slime
dengan caraku sendiri.

14
00:04:14,580 --> 00:04:16,790
Tanpa kusadari, rekan-rekanku bertambah,

15
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:21,169
dan tiba-tiba, aku membangun
negara monster bernama Tempest,

16
00:04:21,170 --> 00:04:23,380
dan aku menjadi raja di sana.

17
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:25,829
Tentu ada,

18
00:04:25,830 --> 00:04:29,540
beberapa pihak yang tidak suka dan mengganggu,

19
00:04:30,210 --> 00:04:32,040
tapi setelah melewati berbagai cobaan,

20
00:04:32,670 --> 00:04:35,670
aku pun menjadi Raja Iblis.

21
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:37,619
Lalu,

22
00:04:37,620 --> 00:04:40,000
keinginanku mengadakan
Festival Pendirian pun terwujud.

23
00:04:40,670 --> 00:04:42,040
Impianku besar.

24
00:04:42,460 --> 00:04:45,670
Membuat dunia yang nyaman ditinggali semua orang.

25
00:04:46,620 --> 00:04:47,670
Hari ini pun,

26
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:50,290
kami masih berjuang mewujudkan itu.

27
00:04:58,080 --> 00:05:00,790
Dan sekarang,

28
00:05:01,380 --> 00:05:03,039
kami sedang ke vila Elmesia

29
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:05,540
untuk merayakan penutupan Festival Pendirian.

30
00:05:44,460 --> 00:05:45,880
Keren!

31
00:05:47,210 --> 00:05:52,040
Siapa sangka kapal naga bisa senyaman ini.

32
00:05:54,210 --> 00:05:57,380
Ternyata ada perjalanan yang sesantai ini.

33
00:05:58,250 --> 00:06:01,039
Baca manga di langit seru juga.

34
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,119
Sakenya juga mantap-mantap!

35
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:05,830
Semua camilannya juga enak!

36
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:08,880
Bentar, kalian terlalu santai di sini.

37
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:12,540
Bahkan kami pun sampai diundang...

38
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:17,540
Syukurlah kalian menyukainya.

39
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,000
Elmesia,

40
00:06:20,420 --> 00:06:22,920
terima kasih atas undangannya.

41
00:06:23,830 --> 00:06:27,120
Terima kasih sudah mengurus semuanya.

42
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:30,670
Kalau cuma sebegini, bukan masalah.

43
00:06:32,290 --> 00:06:33,420
Tetap saja,

44
00:06:33,750 --> 00:06:35,919
kamu pemimpin yang baik

45
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,460
karena bikin wisata penyegaran begini.

46
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:40,040
Aku jadi iri sama kalian.

47
00:06:40,420 --> 00:06:41,669
Enggak juga,

48
00:06:41,670 --> 00:06:44,330
ini cuma rencana impulsif, kok.

49
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,879
Di sekitar vila itu

50
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:48,290
ada apa saja?

51
00:06:48,710 --> 00:06:49,920
Benar juga.

52
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:53,540
Ada pasar dan pelabuhan.

53
00:06:54,290 --> 00:06:55,789
Ada tempat wisata juga,

54
00:06:55,790 --> 00:06:57,620
kalian pasti senang di sana.

55
00:06:58,790 --> 00:07:01,250
Tuan Rimuru, sudah kelihatan!

56
00:07:09,290 --> 00:07:10,500
Indahnya!

57
00:07:10,710 --> 00:07:13,080
Wah, ini melebihi bayanganku.

58
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:16,080
Jadi tidak sabar, ya, Tuan Rimuru.

59
00:07:16,380 --> 00:07:17,170
Iya.

60
00:07:36,790 --> 00:07:37,999
Buruan!

61
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,210
Bentar!

62
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:47,039
Ada kapal naga!

63
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,499
Keren!

64
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:49,540
Ayo!

65
00:08:18,670 --> 00:08:20,120
Selamat datang,

66
00:08:20,420 --> 00:08:21,670
Nona Elmesia.

67
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,289
Tuan Rimuru,

68
00:08:25,290 --> 00:08:27,210
kalau butuh sesuatu, katakan saja pada kami.

69
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:30,290
Terima kasih. Mohon bantuannya, ya.

70
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:50,209
Kalau diperhatikan lagi,

71
00:08:50,210 --> 00:08:52,290
naganya gede juga, ya.

72
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,959
Lapor.

73
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,790
Itu adalah Raja Naga Pelindung.

74
00:08:56,170 --> 00:08:58,920
Bisa dikatakan sejenis Elemental Dragon.

75
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,790
Elemental Dragon?

76
00:09:02,460 --> 00:09:05,289
Benar. Ternyata kamu tahu.

77
00:09:05,290 --> 00:09:06,790
Serius?

78
00:09:07,580 --> 00:09:09,289
Jadi, naga peliharaan Milim

79
00:09:09,290 --> 00:09:11,580
yang dibunuh manusia itu bukan satu-satunya, ya?

80
00:09:12,790 --> 00:09:14,170
Benar.

81
00:09:14,540 --> 00:09:17,000
Masih ada beberapa yang lain juga.

82
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:20,039
Karena jarang menunjukkan diri,

83
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:23,040
sosok mereka jadi sekadar legenda.

84
00:09:30,210 --> 00:09:32,169
Liburan pertamaku!

85
00:09:32,170 --> 00:09:35,670
Aku menantikan pertemuan yang indah!

86
00:09:36,330 --> 00:09:38,290
Ini gerbang masuk ke kota.

87
00:09:38,670 --> 00:09:40,290
Selamat bersenang-senang.

88
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:43,040
Terima kasih atas semua kebaikanmu.

89
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:45,999
Ada kedai!

90
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,669
Apa? Ada kedai, katamu?

91
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:49,080
Langsung meluncur ke sana!

92
00:09:49,790 --> 00:09:50,789
Tunggu, Milim!

93
00:09:50,790 --> 00:09:52,249
Jangan tinggalkan aku!

94
00:09:52,250 --> 00:09:53,250
Wus!

95
00:09:53,830 --> 00:09:56,420
Wah, wah, buru-buru banget.

96
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:59,120
Maafkan mereka, Elmesia.

97
00:09:59,420 --> 00:10:00,670
Tidak apa-apa.

98
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:04,000
Kamu sendiri ada kegiatan apa?

99
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:07,169
Aku sudah menyiapkan sake spesial,

100
00:10:07,170 --> 00:10:08,579
jadi, aku mau menikmatinya.

101
00:10:08,580 --> 00:10:09,749
Sake?

102
00:10:09,750 --> 00:10:11,209
Aku juga ikut!

103
00:10:11,210 --> 00:10:13,830
Kalau spesial, harus dicoba, dong!

104
00:10:14,420 --> 00:10:16,789
Ratu Langit saja bilang itu sake spesial.

105
00:10:16,790 --> 00:10:17,749
Menurutmu?

106
00:10:17,750 --> 00:10:19,290
Sangat layak dinantikan.

107
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:22,670
Lagian tidak ada kegiatan lain.

108
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:24,920
Saya juga mau ikut.

109
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:26,290
Wah, wah.

110
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:31,499
Kalau begitu, ayo kita minum bareng!

111
00:10:31,500 --> 00:10:33,290
Minum-minum!

112
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,540
Bebas sekali hidup mereka.

113
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:36,750
Tuan Rimuru.

114
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:42,330
Kami mau inspeksi pulau ini dulu.

115
00:10:43,540 --> 00:10:45,580
Inspeksi, ya?

116
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:48,039
Iya, pergilah.

117
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:50,420
Aku tunggu tangkapan ikan kalian, ya.

118
00:10:50,540 --> 00:10:51,170
Baik!

119
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:55,790
Jadi, ini rasa bebas di resor, ya?

120
00:10:56,330 --> 00:10:57,540
Tuan Rimuru!

121
00:10:58,580 --> 00:11:00,459
Aku pengin ke pantai!

122
00:11:00,460 --> 00:11:01,499
Boleh juga!

123
00:11:01,500 --> 00:11:02,620
Aku juga!

124
00:11:03,330 --> 00:11:04,920
Pantai, ya?

125
00:11:07,290 --> 00:11:08,709
Iya juga.

126
00:11:08,710 --> 00:11:10,500
Mumpung lagi liburan.

127
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:13,170
Ayo kita nikmati sampai puas!

128
00:11:17,830 --> 00:11:20,079
Kalian pasti terkejut!

129
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:22,170
Karena lautnya benaran indah.

130
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:24,789
Banyak kaum elite Sarion

131
00:11:24,790 --> 00:11:27,540
dan tamu mereka datang ke sini untuk berlibur.

132
00:11:28,170 --> 00:11:30,500
Apa kamu pernah ke sini, Eren?

133
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:33,790
Iya, aku diajak El.

134
00:11:34,460 --> 00:11:37,500
Kuharap yang lain juga diajak ke sini.

135
00:11:38,460 --> 00:11:40,499
Buat mereka yang belum bisa ikut,

136
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:41,749
mungkin bisa ke sini

137
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:43,789
sepulang kita nanti.

138
00:11:43,790 --> 00:11:46,170
Sekretaris kedua tidak usah diajak!

139
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:49,540
Beraninya dia meninggalkan sisi Tuan Rimuru!

140
00:11:49,790 --> 00:11:52,379
Dia tidak becus jadi sekretaris!

141
00:11:52,380 --> 00:11:56,250
Jadi, mau diajak atau tidak, sih?

142
00:11:57,460 --> 00:12:00,620
Diablo sedang di mana, ya?

143
00:12:05,420 --> 00:12:06,830
Kamu ingin anak buah?

144
00:12:07,290 --> 00:12:08,120
Benar.

145
00:12:08,710 --> 00:12:12,170
Saya ingin anak buah yang bisa disuruh-suruh.

146
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:14,330
Untuk bikin teh?

147
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,880
Ah, bukan begitu!

148
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:19,619
Melayani Anda

149
00:12:19,620 --> 00:12:22,170
adalah tugas penting bagi saya.

150
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:25,290
Maksud saya,

151
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:28,000
anak buah yang bisa menggantikan saya

152
00:12:28,580 --> 00:12:32,670
mengerjakan tugas remeh seperti menghancurkan negara.

153
00:12:33,210 --> 00:12:35,580
Dia ngomong apa, sih?

154
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:38,920
Saya punya kenalan lama.

155
00:12:39,960 --> 00:12:42,290
Saya bermaksud untuk merekrut mereka.

156
00:12:42,920 --> 00:12:45,620
Apa Anda mengizinkan saya?

157
00:12:47,170 --> 00:12:48,879
Setelah aku izinkan,

158
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:51,579
dia pergi entah ke mana.

159
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:52,920
Tapi...

160
00:12:53,670 --> 00:12:55,039
Aku jadi khawatir.

161
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:57,789
Entah orang macam apa yang akan dia bawa.

162
00:12:57,790 --> 00:12:58,880
Tuan Rimuru!

163
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:02,119
Lupakan dia dan lihatlah itu!

164
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,000
Laut!

165
00:13:03,250 --> 00:13:04,829
Gede!

166
00:13:04,830 --> 00:13:06,540
Luar biasa!

167
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:29,330
Tempatnya bagus banget.

168
00:13:29,670 --> 00:13:30,670
Iya, kan?

169
00:13:33,830 --> 00:13:35,380
Iya lagi.

170
00:13:37,670 --> 00:13:40,669
Tempatnya benaran bagus.

171
00:13:40,670 --> 00:13:42,290
Iya, ya.

172
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:45,580
Tuan Rimuru!

173
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:48,499
Mau ikut ke sini?

174
00:13:48,500 --> 00:13:50,880
Menyegarkan, lo!

175
00:13:51,460 --> 00:13:53,330
Iya, aku ke sana!

176
00:14:02,830 --> 00:14:04,540
Rimuru Tempest.

177
00:14:13,750 --> 00:14:14,790
Nih!

178
00:14:16,670 --> 00:14:18,619
Duh, Tuan Rimuru!

179
00:14:18,620 --> 00:14:20,169
Balas sini!

180
00:14:20,170 --> 00:14:20,880
Nih!

181
00:14:21,620 --> 00:14:22,880
Berani juga kalian!

182
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:25,250
Kami di sini!

183
00:14:29,750 --> 00:14:32,170
Tuan Rimuru, ada apa?

184
00:14:36,830 --> 00:14:38,790
Apa itu?

185
00:14:41,500 --> 00:14:43,919
Ah, mantap banget!

186
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:45,500
Nona Ramiris, jangan berlebihan.

187
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:47,330
Biar saja.

188
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:57,709
Itu terbang dari mana?

189
00:14:57,710 --> 00:14:58,670
Entah.

190
00:15:02,380 --> 00:15:03,670
Cahaya itu...

191
00:15:04,710 --> 00:15:05,500
Lapor.

192
00:15:05,920 --> 00:15:07,620
Sepertinya itu sihir nuklir.

193
00:15:07,830 --> 00:15:09,920
Tidak akan berdampak di pulau ini.

194
00:15:10,790 --> 00:15:11,790
Begitu, ya?

195
00:15:15,170 --> 00:15:16,290
Aku harus bergegas!

196
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,209
Serangan datang!

197
00:15:22,210 --> 00:15:23,880
Peringatan darurat ke seluruh negeri!

198
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:28,120
Semuanya, lindungi kepala kalian!

199
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:59,000
Sebenarnya apa itu tadi?

200
00:16:00,330 --> 00:16:01,209
Lapor.

201
00:16:01,210 --> 00:16:03,459
Selain hantaman sihir nuklir,

202
00:16:03,460 --> 00:16:06,620
terdeteksi satu pantulan getaran
di satu titik lainnya.

203
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:09,120
Titik lainnya?

204
00:16:13,290 --> 00:16:14,959
Jadi, itu yang dirumorkan...

205
00:16:14,960 --> 00:16:17,170
Leon pasti kerepotan, nih.

206
00:16:17,830 --> 00:16:18,919
Leon?

207
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:21,380
Maksudnya, Raja Iblis Leon Cromwell?

208
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:23,120
Iya.

209
00:16:23,790 --> 00:16:26,170
Kenapa Tuan Leon dibahas?

210
00:16:26,670 --> 00:16:31,249
Negeri Emas El Dorado milik Leon ada di dekat sini,

211
00:16:31,250 --> 00:16:34,330
dan kabarnya ada orang yang berbuat usil di sana.

212
00:16:35,380 --> 00:16:36,290
Usil?

213
00:16:37,170 --> 00:16:39,749
Katanya Raja Iblis Leon menghalau dan membalikkan

214
00:16:39,750 --> 00:16:42,830
sihir nuklir itu dengan pelindungnya.

215
00:16:44,330 --> 00:16:46,420
Kedengarannya merepotkan.

216
00:16:47,460 --> 00:16:49,880
Bagaimana dengan penduduk pulau?

217
00:16:50,290 --> 00:16:52,460
Kudengar baik-baik saja.

218
00:16:52,880 --> 00:16:54,499
Dia menjatuhkannya di lepas pantai jauh

219
00:16:54,500 --> 00:16:57,290
supaya tidak memengaruhi pulau.

220
00:16:58,920 --> 00:17:02,710
Leon pun masih mempertimbangkan hal itu.

221
00:17:04,250 --> 00:17:06,710
Katanya para penduduk juga sudah terbiasa.

222
00:17:09,829 --> 00:17:11,460
Kita makan apa malam ini?

223
00:17:13,670 --> 00:17:15,420
Baguslah, kalau begitu.

224
00:17:16,619 --> 00:17:21,290
Tetap saja, kira-kira siapa orang
yang berani mengusili Raja Iblis?

225
00:17:31,540 --> 00:17:33,170
Selalu melakukan hal sia-sia.

226
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:37,790
Apa iblis itu tidak ada bosannya?

227
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:41,669
Itu sudah menjadi

228
00:17:41,670 --> 00:17:43,750
kebiasaan penghuni sana.

229
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:46,670
Benar-benar merepotkan.

230
00:17:54,210 --> 00:17:56,880
Djeese, kamu di mana?

231
00:17:59,290 --> 00:18:00,209
Saya di sini.

232
00:18:00,210 --> 00:18:02,079
Oh, Djeese!

233
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,079
Kalau terus begini,

234
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:04,880
negeri kita bisa hancur.

235
00:18:06,460 --> 00:18:09,670
Apa Naga Air belum bangun juga?

236
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:12,039
Kami sedang mencari Taring Naga

237
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:13,790
yang dicuri itu.

238
00:18:15,580 --> 00:18:17,329
Kenapa lama sekali?

239
00:18:17,330 --> 00:18:20,790
Kita butuh kekuatan Naga Air secepat mungkin!

240
00:18:21,710 --> 00:18:24,209
Saya sedang mengutus Zodon ke sana.

241
00:18:24,210 --> 00:18:25,670
Mohon tunggu sebentar.

242
00:18:41,620 --> 00:18:44,079
Dagangannya bervariasi, ya.

243
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:46,210
Beli oleh-oleh apa, ya?

244
00:18:46,540 --> 00:18:48,960
Nah, bikin bingung pilih, kan?

245
00:18:53,580 --> 00:18:54,920
Ah, imutnya.

246
00:18:56,880 --> 00:18:58,919
Bagaimana kalau ini saja?

247
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:00,170
Imut juga.

248
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:02,709
Wah, produknya bagus juga.

249
00:19:02,710 --> 00:19:05,040
Itu buatan penduduk pulau ini, lo.

250
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:08,210
Ternyata ini juga sumber pendapatan, ya.

251
00:19:08,420 --> 00:19:11,500
Di sana juga ada hiasan rambut imut.

252
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:15,040
Oleh-oleh mah tinggal asal pilih saja.

253
00:19:16,330 --> 00:19:18,290
