01:30:43,500 --> 01:30:45,000
Yura!

1167
01:30:52,670 --> 01:30:56,210
Yura, aku mencintaimu!

1168
01:30:57,880 --> 01:30:59,620
Gobta!

1169
01:31:04,330 --> 01:31:06,500
Menyingkirlah dari Yura!

1170
01:31:04,330 --> 01:31:07,619
