1178
01:31:22,580 --> 01:31:23,620
Sinar Megiddo!

1179
01:31:22,750 --> 01:31:26,379
{\an8}Jangan hancurkan aku, kuakan hidup bersamamu ♪

1180
01:31:26,380 --> 01:31:31,329
