1181
01:31:31,330 --> 01:31:36,499
{\an8}kutelusuri pemandangan bermandikan cahaya

1182
01:31:36,500 --> 01:31:41,669
{\an8}Dorongan hati yang ingin hidup bersama ♪

1183
01:31:41,670 --> 01:31:45,170
