Lagi-lagi dia asal bicara.

1227
01:35:32,000 --> 01:35:34,620
Hentikan tatapanmu itu!

1228
01:35:36,460 --> 01:35:37,999
Aku akan setia padamu!

1229
01:35:38,000 --> 01:35:40,169
Hei, jangan begitu, lah.

1230
01:35:40,170 --> 01:35:41,329
Tenang saja,

1231
01:35:41,330 --> 01:35:43,079
