1232
01:35:43,080 --> 01:35:45,499
Aku ingin tanya sesuatu, nih.

1233
01:35:45,500 --> 01:35:47,790
Santai dulu, lah.

1234
01:35:50,380 --> 01:35:53,420
Tanpa adanya Naga Air,

1235
