1238
01:36:01,000 --> 01:36:01,830
Baik!

1239
01:36:03,040 --> 01:36:04,329
Mana Yura?

1240
01:36:04,330 --> 01:36:06,380
Kenapa dia tidak hadir?

1241
01:36:07,330 --> 01:36:08,290
Nona Yura.

1242
