Kamu boleh pergi.

1247
01:37:16,380 --> 01:37:17,460
Maaf.

1248
01:37:18,210 --> 01:37:19,170
Gobta.

1249
01:37:20,330 --> 01:37:23,120
Sebenarnya, saat itu,

1250
01:37:23,460 --> 01:37:24,330
