1265
01:38:43,170 --> 01:38:44,460
Kamu menyadarinya?

1266
01:38:45,250 --> 01:38:46,920
Cuma firasatku, sih.

1267
01:38:52,710 --> 01:38:57,499
Pukul dua di pagi buta, perjalanan dimulai ♪

1268
01:38:57,500 --> 01:39:02,290
